check_nprobe_equals_nlists_is_brute_force OK [IDENTICAL]: 120 slots, distances AND indices bit for bit against neighbors/ knn_search's TILED arm; every query scored all 320 candidates
  refused  algorithm=ivf_pq: ivf_pq: NOT IMPLEMENTED. cuvs/src/neighbors/ivf_pq/ is a different algorithm (product quantization, a codebook per subspace and a LUT scan), out of this lane's scope by its brief. See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  algorithm=hnsw: hnsw: REFUSED PERMANENTLY in this repository. cuVS's cpp/include/cuvs/neighbors/hnsw.hpp dispatches to the hnswlib CPU graph; it is not a GPU algorithm and ENGINEERING_RULES.md 0b-ii says there is no CPU path here. This is a refusal, not an unimplemented item, and it does not become one later.
  refused  algorithm=cagra: cagra: NOT IMPLEMENTED. cuvs/src/neighbors/cagra.cuh is a graph index, out of this lane's scope by its brief. See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  algorithm=ivf_sq: ivf_sq: NOT IMPLEMENTED (cuvs/src/neighbors/ivf_sq/, scalar quantization over an IVF index). See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  algorithm=ivf_rabitq: ivf_rabitq: NOT IMPLEMENTED (cuvs/src/neighbors/ivf_rabitq/). See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  algorithm=scann: scann: NOT IMPLEMENTED. See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  algorithm=vamana: vamana: NOT IMPLEMENTED. See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  algorithm=nn_descent: nn_descent: NOT IMPLEMENTED. See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  metric=cosine: ivf_flat: metric 'cosine' is CosineExpanded, which is ivf_flat_search.cuh:130-141's own arm (a per-cell divide by the norm product) and is NOT IMPLEMENTED. See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  metric=inner_product: ivf_flat: metric 'inner_product' takes ivf_flat_search.cuh:142-145's default arm (alpha=1, beta=0, select_max) and is NOT IMPLEMENTED. See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  metric=hamming: ivf_flat: unknown metric 'hamming'. This implementation carries l2_expanded and l2_sqrt_expanded.
  refused  metric=CosineExpanded: ivf_flat build: metric CosineExpanded is not implemented; this implementation carries L2Expanded and L2SqrtExpanded (ivf_flat_search.cuh:110-129's arm).
  refused  kmeans_trainset_fraction=0.5 (DEVIATION 1781): ivf_flat build: kmeans_trainset_fraction = 0.5 is REFUSED (DEVIATION 1781). Their trainset row count (ivf_flat_build.cuh:416-418) is a truncated float product, so near an integer boundary two hosts train the quantizer on DIFFERENT ROWS and the whole index differs. Only 1.0 (the whole dataset, no truncation) is accepted. Closure: implementation their stride as exact integer arithmetic, the way IDENTITY_PATHS row 18 closed compute_max_features.
  refused  adaptive_centers=True: ivf_flat build: adaptive_centers=True is NOT IMPLEMENTED (DEVIATION 1793). Their own header says it makes the centroids depend on the ORDER new data is added in (ivf_flat.hpp:41-46); that is an order dependence in the index itself, and extend() is not implemented either.
  refused  conservative_memory_allocation=True: ivf_flat build: conservative_memory_allocation is NOT IMPLEMENTED (DEVIATION 1782). It selects `align_max` for their per-list allocation (ivf_flat.hpp:96-100); this implementation lays the lists out CSR and has no per-list allocation to align.
  refused  add_data_on_build=False: ivf_flat build: add_data_on_build=False is NOT IMPLEMENTED (DEVIATION 1793). It leaves the index trained and empty for a later extend(), and extend() is not implemented. See ivf/NOT_IMPLEMENTED.tsv.
  refused  n_lists > n_rows (their :404): ivf_flat build: number of rows (320) can't be less than n_lists (321), their RAFT_EXPECTS at ivf_flat_build.cuh:404
  refused  n_probes=0: ivf_flat search: n_probes (number of clusters to probe) must be positive, their RAFT_EXPECTS at ivf_flat_search.cuh:329
  refused  n_probes=7: ivf_flat search: n_probes (7) exceeds n_lists (6). Theirs clamps at ivf_flat_search.cuh:331; this implementation REFUSES, because n_probes is a numeric parameter (DEVIATION 1787) and a clamped one is a card that does not say which computation ran.
  refused  NaN in the dataset: ivf_flat: dataset value at flat position 3 (row 1, column 1) is not finite. Every stage here is a card stage and a computed NaN carries the vendor's payload (IDENTITY_PATHS row 39).
  refused  +inf in the dataset: ivf_flat: dataset value at flat position 1 (row 0, column 1) is not finite. Every stage here is a card stage and a computed NaN carries the vendor's payload (IDENTITY_PATHS row 39).
  refused  probed lists hold fewer than k: ivf_flat search: query 0 probes 1 lists holding 1 vectors between them, fewer than k = 5. Their kOutOfBoundsRecord short-fill (ivf_common.cuh:106-108) is not implemented. Raise n_probes, or lower k, or rebuild with fewer lists.
